      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While it's true that some people experience lingering fatigue post-viral, it's crucial not to ignore symptoms like yours. Although high doses of magnesium and electrolytes might help with some minor cramps or muscle pains, your symptoms are more serious and suggest you could be dealing with more than just post-viral fatigue. It's better to consult a healthcare provider to get a professional assessment, avoid potential complications, and potentially save on future healthcare costs. Your health and well-being should always be the priority.",
      "source": "target",
